Z||000000||fieroburton||09-23-2001||09:46 PM||||I would like to try a v8 swap but I don't know how the process and tools they use to do the swap. so I have a few questions about it <BR>what type of tools do a person needs?<BR>can some body do the whole project with little to none mechanical ability?<BR>can it be don in my back yard?<BR>were can I get the cheapest v8's?<BR>if it can be don with little mechanical experience I might be able to do it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||5
