Z||000007||FieroLT1||09-25-2001||07:25 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fieroburton:<BR><B>so im taking it that it takes lots of work and bunches of time.<BR>well that's something I don't have   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>can Archie build one for me?<BR>I heard or seen something before about it and it cost like $10,000 or so.<BR>have any body have one built by Archie?<BR>if so can  you give me some details ?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>For a plain Jane Chevy SBC is a lot less than that, and all you have to do is take your car in. He'll take care of the rest if that is what you want.<BR>Give him a call for more info.<BR>1-800-891-3608 <A HREF="http://www.v8Archie.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8Archie.com</A> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Winston Ojeda<BR><B>88 Formula LT1</B><BR>Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA<BR><A HREF="http://www.FieroLT1.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.FieroLT1.com</A><BR><I>Home of the Fiero LT1</I><BR>  <A HREF="mailto:wojeda@FieroLT1.com">wojeda@FieroLT1.com</A> ||||reg||1
