Z||000009||Jay||09-25-2001||04:03 PM||||I've never done an engine conversion before either until I chose the Northstar.  <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/jaygrande" TARGET=_blank>www.members.home.net/jaygrande</A>  If I can do it anyone can.  Whatever is too difficult or beyond simple machanics just source out.  For example I can weld but I don't trust my welds for the engine cradle, so I paid someone to do it for me.  Bite the bullet and try it.  You'll feel a great sense of accomplishment.<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
